# Afenda feature scaffold (`packages/features/**`)

Scaffold default: [`packages/_template-definition`](../../packages/_template-definition).

## Public doors (`src/`)

- `src/index.ts` → export `.`
- `src/client.ts` → export `./client`
- `src/server.ts` → export `./server`
- `src/metadata.ts` → export `./metadata`

## Template buckets

- `src/actions/`
- `src/components/`
- `src/contracts/`
- `src/data/`
- `src/events/`
- `src/policies/`
- `src/schemas/`
- `src/tests/`

## Non-negotiables

- Do not add catch-all folders: `_shared`, `shared`, `common`, `lib`, `utils`, `helpers`, `misc`, `internal`.
- Module components live in `src/components/`, not `apps/erp`.
- TypeScript schemas live in `src/schemas/`; `@afenda/db` owns SQL and migrations.
- Server Actions in `src/actions/**` (`*.actions.server.ts`).
- Client components in `src/components/**` (`*.client.tsx`).
- Feature packages never own Drizzle DDL; schema DDL remains in `@afenda/db`.

## Tools

- `pnpm scaffold:feature <moduleId>` — delegate to `packages/_template-definition/scripts`
- `pnpm scaffold:vertical <feature> <vertical>` — add template buckets under a vertical folder in `src/`
- `pnpm architecture:check` — before finishing scaffold changes
